    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You are hidden by a personal cloaking field: <strong>Undetected</strong> by all creatures until you make a Strike or the start of your next turn.</p><p>Your first Strike while cloaked deals <strong>2d6 precision damage</strong> more, and its target is off-guard to it. The dice are multiplied by level as a power's are: 4d6 at 4th level, 6d6 at 8th, 8d6 at 12th, 10d6 at 16th and 12d6 at 20th. The effect comes off by itself after that Strike.</p>"
